<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela to export 3.3 million bpd in 98 - PDVSA.</title>
<headline>Venezuela to export 3.3 million bpd in 98 - PDVSA.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuela will export an average of 3.3 million barrels per day (bpd) of crude oil and products in 1998, said Luis Urdaneta, vice-president of state oil company Petroleos de Venezuela.</p>
</text>
